    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c27b3ab3c8@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>Stryker Corporation (NYSE:SYK) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.38 per share payable on October 31, 2016 to shareholders of record at the close of business on September 30, 2016, representing an increase of 10% versus the prior year and unchanged from the previous quarter.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://investors.stryker.com/press-releases/news-details/2016/Stryker-declares-a-038-per-share-quarterly-dividend-20160427000000/default.aspx\">See full release here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n",
